  "faqTitle": "FAQ",
  "faq1Q": "What is GuidaTour?",
  "faq1A": "A platform to discover tours and experiences offered by approved tourist guides, tour leaders and tour operators. GuidaTour puts travellers in touch with professionals: it does not organise tours or take payments.",
  "faq2Q": "How do I book a tour?",
  "faq2A": "Open the tour page and send a booking request. The request is not binding: the organiser will reply to confirm availability and details.",
  "faq3Q": "Do I pay online?",
  "faq3A": "No. You agree payment directly with the organiser, as they will explain.",
  "faq4Q": "What is the difference between a guide, a tour leader and a tour operator?",
  "faq4A": "A licensed tourist guide leads guided visits. A tour leader provides assistance and support to groups, but not specialist guided visits. A verified tour operator can offer packages with extra services, such as dinner or transfers.",
  "faq5Q": "How can I publish my tours?",
  "faq5A": "Sign up choosing the guide, tour leader or tour operator profile. Once an administrator approves you, you can publish your tours and receive requests.",
  "faq6Q": "What is the QR code on the posters for?",
  "faq6A": "Scan it with your phone to open the tour page, where you can read the details and send a request.",
  "faq7Q": "How do I get tours on WhatsApp?",
  "faq7A": "Leave your number in the WhatsApp box and give your consent. You can withdraw it at any time by replying STOP.",
